('shuffle-medium-4','shuffle','medium','BOOTSTRAP','["BOOTSTRAP"]','BOOTSTRAP: Build a business primarily using your own resources.','','{"prompt":"Build a business primarily using your own resources.","wordLengths":[9]}'),
