('shuffle-hard-3','shuffle','hard','SEED ROUND','["SEED ROUND"]','SEED ROUND: An early funding stage that helps a new startup build and test its product.','','{"prompt":"An early funding stage that helps a new startup build and test its product.","wordLengths":[4,5]}'),
('shuffle-hard-4','shuffle','hard','PITCH DECK','["PITCH DECK"]','PITCH DECK: A slide presentation used to pitch a business idea to investors.','','{"prompt":"A slide presentation used to pitch a business idea to investors.","wordLengths":[5,4]}'),
('shuffle-hard-5','shuffle','hard','DISRUPTION','["DISRUPTION"]','DISRUPTION: Innovation that transforms an existing market and displaces incumbents.','','{"prompt":"Innovation that transforms an existing market and displaces incumbents.","wordLengths":[10]}'),
('shuffle-hard-6','shuffle','hard','ACQUISITION','["ACQUISITION"]','ACQUISITION: When one company purchases and takes control of another business.','','{"prompt":"When one company purchases and takes control of another business.","wordLengths":[11]}'),
('shuffle-hard-7','shuffle','hard','DUE DILIGENCE','["DUE DILIGENCE"]','DUE DILIGENCE: Careful investigation before making a business deal.','','{"prompt":"Careful investigation before making a business deal.","wordLengths":[3,9]}'),
('shuffle-hard-8','shuffle','hard','SUPPLY CHAIN','["SUPPLY CHAIN"]','SUPPLY CHAIN: The network moving a product from suppliers to customers.','','{"prompt":"The network moving a product from suppliers to customers.","wordLengths":[6,5]}'),
('shuffle-hard-9','shuffle','hard','UNIT ECONOMICS','["UNIT ECONOMICS"]','UNIT ECONOMICS: Revenue and costs considered for one unit or customer.','','{"prompt":"Revenue and costs considered for one unit or customer.","wordLengths":[4,9]}'),
('shuffle-hard-10','shuffle','hard','BUSINESS MODEL','["BUSINESS MODEL"]','BUSINESS MODEL: How a business creates, delivers and captures value.','','{"prompt":"How a business creates, delivers and captures value.","wordLengths":[8,5]}'),
('brand-easy-1','brand','easy','Google','["Google"]','Google: My wider family includes maps, email and tools for working together. A colourful letter sits above a familiar search box.','https://about.google/','{"clues":["A question often sends people to my front door.","My wider family includes maps, email and tools for working together.","A colourful letter sits above a familiar search box."]}'),
('brand-easy-2','brand','easy','YouTube','["YouTube"]','YouTube: Creators build channels here, and viewers subscribe to them. A red play symbol is at the centre of my identity.','https://www.youtube.com/about/','{"clues":["People come to me to learn a skill or lose track of time.","Creators build channels here, and viewers subscribe to them.","A red play symbol is at the centre of my identity."]}'),
('brand-easy-3','brand','easy','WhatsApp','["WhatsApp"]','WhatsApp: My conversations can include voice notes, calls and disappearing updates. My green speech bubble contains a telephone handset.','https://www.whatsapp.com/','{"clues":["I often carry both family plans and group-project reminders.","My conversations can include voice notes, calls and disappearing updates.","My green speech bubble contains a telephone handset."]}'),
('brand-easy-4','brand','easy','Netflix','["Netflix"]','Netflix: I commission original entertainment as well as offering licensed shows. A red initial appears before many streaming sessions.','https://about.netflix.com/','{"clues":["One more episode can turn into a very late night with me.","I commission original entertainment as well as offering licensed shows.","A red initial appears before many streaming sessions."]}'),
('brand-easy-5','brand','easy','Spotify','["Spotify"]','Spotify: Listeners organise playlists and receive personal listening summaries. My green circular mark contains three curved sound lines.','https://www.spotify.com/','{"clues":["I can provide the soundtrack to a commute or study session.","Listeners organise playlists and receive personal listening summaries.","My green circular mark contains three curved sound lines."]}'),
('brand-easy-6','brand','easy','Uber','["Uber"]','Uber: Customers can compare a trip estimate and follow their driver on a map. The same account can help arrange a ride or a delivered meal.','https://www.uber.com/','{"clues":["I connect demand with people already moving through a city.","Customers can compare a trip estimate and follow their driver on a map.","The same account can help arrange a ride or a delivered meal."]}'),
('brand-easy-7','brand','easy','Apple','["Apple"]','Apple: My devices are built to work closely together in one ecosystem. My minimal symbol is a piece of fruit with a bite missing.','https://www.apple.com/','{"clues":["I put design, hardware and software under one roof.","My devices are built to work closely together in one ecosystem.","My minimal symbol is a piece of fruit with a bite missing."]}'),
('brand-easy-8','brand','easy','Red Bull','["Red Bull"]','Red Bull: My name appears around motorsport and extreme-sport events. Two charging animals face each other against a yellow disc on my cans.','https://www.redbull.com/us-en/energydrink','{"clues":["I promote a lifestyle of energy, performance and daring.","My name appears around motorsport and extreme-sport events.","Two charging animals face each other against a yellow disc on my cans."]}'),
('brand-medium-1','brand','medium','PickMe','["PickMe","Pick Me"]','PickMe: My Sri Lankan platform connects people with rides and deliveries. A tuk-tuk journey and a meal order can begin in the same yellow-branded app.','https://pickme.lk/','{"clues":["I turn local transport availability into something you can request by phone.","My Sri Lankan platform connects people with rides and deliveries.","A tuk-tuk journey and a meal order can begin in the same yellow-branded app."]}'),
('brand-medium-2','brand','medium','Canva','["Canva"]','Canva: Templates and drag-and-drop tools make visual work accessible to non-designers. A class presentation, social post and event poster can all start in my browser-based editor.','https://www.canva.com/about/','{"clues":["I help people turn a blank page into something ready to share.","Templates and drag-and-drop tools make visual work accessible to non-designers.","A class presentation, social post and event poster can all start in my browser-based editor."]}'),
('brand-medium-3','brand','medium','Samsung','["Samsung"]','Samsung: My range spans phones, screens and household appliances. A galaxy is the identity of my mobile-device family.','https://www.samsung.com/','{"clues":["My products can be found both in pockets and around the home.","My range spans phones, screens and household appliances.","A galaxy is the identity of my mobile-device family."]}'),
('brand-medium-4','brand','medium','Nike','["Nike"]','Nike: Footwear, sportswear and athlete partnerships are central to my business. My simple curved tick can identify a shoe without any written name.','https://about.nike.com/','{"clues":["I build a strong connection between identity and athletic effort.","Footwear, sportswear and athlete partnerships are central to my business.","My simple curved tick can identify a shoe without any written name."]}'),
('brand-medium-5','brand','medium','Elephant House','["Elephant House"]','Elephant House: My range brings together carbonated drinks and ice cream. Cream Soda and a well-known local ginger beer belong to my drinks family.','https://www.elephanthouse.lk/exports/','{"clues":["I am part of both refreshment breaks and frozen celebrations in Sri Lanka.","My range brings together carbonated drinks and ice cream.","Cream Soda and a well-known local ginger beer belong to my drinks family."]}'),
('brand-medium-6','brand','medium','Dialog','["Dialog"]','Dialog: Mobile connections, home broadband and television sit in my portfolio. A folded, multicoloured geometric symbol appears on my reload and SIM branding.','https://dialog.lk/','{"clues":["My services help Sri Lankans stay connected at home and on the move.","Mobile connections, home broadband and television sit in my portfolio.","A folded, multicoloured geometric symbol appears on my reload and SIM branding."]}'),
('brand-medium-7','brand','medium','Munchee','["Munchee"]','Munchee: I am a Sri Lankan biscuit brand within the CBL family. Super Cream Cracker and Tikiri Marie are among my biscuit names.','https://www.cbllk.com/our-history','{"clues":["I often appear beside a cup of tea or inside a school snack bag.","I am a Sri Lankan biscuit brand within the CBL family.","Super Cream Cracker and Tikiri Marie are among my biscuit names."]}'),
('brand-medium-8','brand','medium','Dilmah','["Dilmah"]','Dilmah: Single-origin Ceylon tea is central to my identity. My founder was Merrill J. Fernando; my name combines those of his two sons.','https://www.dilmahtea.com/','{"clues":["I took a Sri Lankan agricultural product to an international audience.","Single-origin Ceylon tea is central to my identity.","My founder was Merrill J. Fernando; my name combines those of his two sons."]}'),
('brand-hard-1','brand','hard','Keells','["Keells","Keells Super"]','Keells: I run a Sri Lankan supermarket chain within a long-established diversified business group. Green is a strong part of my supermarket identity, from signs to shopping bags.','https://www.keellssuper.com/','{"clues":["My everyday business depends on fresh stock, convenient locations and repeat visits.","I run a Sri Lankan supermarket chain within a long-established diversified business group.","Green is a strong part of my supermarket identity, from signs to shopping bags."]}'),
('brand-hard-2','brand','hard','Cargills','["Cargills","Cargills Food City","Food City"]','Cargills: A nationwide supermarket network sits alongside my food-manufacturing interests. Food City is the name above many of my supermarket doors.','https://www.cargillsceylon.com/retail/','{"clues":["I link household shopping with a wider Sri Lankan food business.","A nationwide supermarket network sits alongside my food-manufacturing interests.","Food City is the name above many of my supermarket doors."]}'),
('brand-hard-3','brand','hard','Daraz','["Daraz"]','Daraz: In Sri Lanka, my marketplace offers categories from electronics to household goods. My orange branding is associated with large double-digit-date shopping campaigns.','https://www.daraz.lk/','{"clues":["I bring many independent sellers into a single digital shopping destination.","In Sri Lanka, my marketplace offers categories from electronics to household goods.","My orange branding is associated with large double-digit-date shopping campaigns."]}'),
('brand-hard-4','brand','hard','Maliban','["Maliban"]','Maliban: Biscuits are central to my business, alongside a wider food portfolio. Gold Marie, Lemon Puff and Cream Cracker appear in my biscuit range.','https://www.malibangroup.com/','{"clues":["I turned a familiar tea-time habit into an enduring Sri Lankan brand.","Biscuits are central to my business, alongside a wider food portfolio.","Gold Marie, Lemon Puff and Cream Cracker appear in my biscuit range."]}'),
('brand-hard-5','brand','hard','Spa Ceylon','["Spa Ceylon","SpaCeylon"]','Spa Ceylon: Ayurveda-inspired bath, body and home-aroma products are central to my range. Bright decorative packaging and a royal-elephant motif help identify my stores.','https://lk.spaceylon.com/','{"clues":["I sell a sensory experience rooted in the island’s wellbeing traditions.","Ayurveda-inspired bath, body and home-aroma products are central to my range.","Bright decorative packaging and a royal-elephant motif help identify my stores."]}'),
('brand-hard-6','brand','hard','Singer','["Singer"]','Singer: Sri Lankan customers now buy appliances and electronics from my showrooms. Sewing machines were the product that made my name familiar in many homes.','https://www.singersl.com/','{"clues":["My story connects an old household craft with modern home retail.","Sri Lankan customers now buy appliances and electronics from my showrooms.","Sewing machines were the product that made my name familiar in many homes."]}'),
('brand-hard-7','brand','hard','Airbnb','["Airbnb"]','Airbnb: Hosts list accommodation while travellers compare places and reviews. Instead of a hotel room, a booking might place you inside someone’s apartment.','https://news.airbnb.com/about-us/','{"clues":["My model lets people earn from space they already have.","Hosts list accommodation while travellers compare places and reviews.","Instead of a hotel room, a booking might place you inside someone’s apartment."]}'),
('brand-hard-8','brand','hard','IKEA','["IKEA"]','IKEA: My model is associated with flat-pack furniture and customer assembly. A Swedish identity, blue-and-yellow stores and furniture showrooms help distinguish me.','https://www.ikea.com/','{"clues":["I make room design part of a large-scale retail experience.","My model is associated with flat-pack furniture and customer assembly.","A Swedish identity, blue-and-yellow stores and furniture showrooms help distinguish me."]}'),
('pivot-easy-1','deal','easy','Launch-day checkout','["b"]','The tested alternative preserves a working purchase path and order records while the fault is fixed.','','{"format":"pivot","prompt":"Launch-day checkout","scenario":"Your launch is tomorrow. Checkout fails in testing. A tested payment alternative is available.","objective":"Take reliable, traceable orders.","options":[{"id":"a","text":"Cancel the launch without investigating"},{"id":"b","text":"Use the tested alternative and explain the change"},{"id":"c","text":"Take payments without recording orders"},{"id":"d","text":"Launch the broken checkout"}],"hasUpdate":false}'),
('pivot-easy-2','deal','easy','The mystery feature','["d"]','Interviews with target customers test the underlying problem before development time is committed.','','{"format":"pivot","prompt":"The mystery feature","scenario":"You can interview five target customers today, or spend the day building an unrequested feature.","objective":"Learn which problem matters before building.","options":[{"id":"a","text":"Ask only your own team"},{"id":"b","text":"Copy a competitor’s screen"},{"id":"c","text":"Build the feature first"},{"id":"d","text":"Interview the five target customers"}],"hasUpdate":false}'),
('pivot-easy-3','deal','easy','Wrong delivery','["b"]','Acknowledge the confirmed mistake and offer a specific remedy rather than adding friction.','','{"format":"pivot","prompt":"Wrong delivery","scenario":"A customer receives the wrong item. Your records confirm the packing mistake.","objective":"Correct the mistake and retain trust.","options":[{"id":"a","text":"Ask them to pay for another item"},{"id":"b","text":"Offer a clear replacement or refund"},{"id":"c","text":"Wait for a public complaint"},{"id":"d","text":"Delete the support message"}],"hasUpdate":false}'),
('pivot-easy-4','deal','easy','The empty shelf','["d"]','Correct the listing and communicate with existing buyers so new orders do not rely on a false delivery promise.','','{"format":"pivot","prompt":"The empty shelf","scenario":"A product is out of stock, but your shop still promises next-day delivery.","objective":"Stop customers buying an unavailable promise.","options":[{"id":"a","text":"Keep the promise until someone complains"},{"id":"b","text":"Increase advertising"},{"id":"c","text":"Hide support contact details"},{"id":"d","text":"Update availability and notify affected buyers"}],"hasUpdate":false}'),
('pivot-easy-5','deal','easy','The forgotten owner','["a"]','An explicit owner and deadline turn a shared assumption into an accountable action.','','{"format":"pivot","prompt":"The forgotten owner","scenario":"Three teammates assume someone else is contacting the venue. The deadline is today.","objective":"Get the booking confirmed today.","options":[{"id":"a","text":"Assign an owner and a confirmation deadline"},{"id":"b","text":"Wait for a volunteer"},{"id":"c","text":"Book a second venue without checking"},{"id":"d","text":"Create another group chat only"}],"hasUpdate":false}'),
('pivot-easy-6','deal','easy','First ten users','["a"]','Repeated task failure identifies a usability problem worth fixing before adding traffic or features.','','{"format":"pivot","prompt":"First ten users","scenario":"Ten people try your prototype. Six cannot find the main action button.","objective":"Remove the clearest obstacle to completing the task.","options":[{"id":"a","text":"Make the main action easier to find and retest"},{"id":"b","text":"Buy more ads for the same screen"},{"id":"c","text":"Add more optional features"},{"id":"d","text":"Change the company name"}],"hasUpdate":false}'),
('pivot-easy-7','deal','easy','The missing brief','["b"]','A short agreed brief establishes the communication goal before design effort is spent.','','{"format":"pivot","prompt":"The missing brief","scenario":"A designer is about to begin, but nobody has agreed what the poster should communicate.","objective":"Avoid unnecessary design rework.","options":[{"id":"a","text":"Send feedback after printing"},{"id":"b","text":"Agree audience, message and required details first"},{"id":"c","text":"Request ten random designs"},{"id":"d","text":"Choose a colour and skip the message"}],"hasUpdate":false}'),
('pivot-easy-8','deal','easy','Sold-out workshop','["d"]','A waiting list records demand without falsely confirming additional capacity.','','{"format":"pivot","prompt":"Sold-out workshop","scenario":"Every confirmed seat is filled. More people want to attend.","objective":"Avoid promising seats you cannot provide.","options":[{"id":"a","text":"Keep selling confirmed seats"},{"id":"b","text":"Remove capacity details"},{"id":"c","text":"Let all buyers discover the issue at the door"},{"id":"d","text":"Open a clearly labelled waiting list"}],"hasUpdate":false}'),
('pivot-easy-9','deal','easy','A risky testimonial','["a"]','Confirm permission for the actual wording and attribution before using the customer’s identity.','','{"format":"pivot","prompt":"A risky testimonial","scenario":"You want to publish a customer quote with their name and photo. They have not agreed.","objective":"Use a genuine testimonial with permission.","options":[{"id":"a","text":"Ask for approval of the quote and attribution"},{"id":"b","text":"Invent a similar quote"},{"id":"c","text":"Assume a purchase grants permission"},{"id":"d","text":"Publish before asking"}],"hasUpdate":false}'),
('pivot-easy-10','deal','easy','The unclear price','["a"]','Show the full pricing terms before purchase so customers can make an informed choice.','','{"format":"pivot","prompt":"The unclear price","scenario":"Customers keep asking whether delivery is included. It is charged separately.","objective":"Make the purchase cost clear before checkout.","options":[{"id":"a","text":"State the item price and delivery charge clearly"},{"id":"b","text":"Tell only customers who ask"},{"id":"c","text":"Hide the fee until payment"},{"id":"d","text":"Remove all prices"}],"hasUpdate":false}'),
('pivot-medium-1','deal','medium','A popular broken page','["a"]','More traffic cannot fix a blocked purchase path. Repair and test that path first.','','{"format":"pivot","prompt":"A popular broken page","scenario":"Your campaign brings many visitors, but a checkout error prevents purchases.","objective":"Restore the purchase path before increasing traffic.","options":[{"id":"a","text":"Fix checkout and verify a successful test order"},{"id":"b","text":"Redesign the logo"},{"id":"c","text":"Add a second discount to the broken page"},{"id":"d","text":"Double the ad budget"}],"hasUpdate":false}'),
('pivot-medium-2','deal','medium','Orders or capacity?','["a"]','Control incoming commitments and give affected customers clear options instead of hiding the capacity problem.','','{"format":"pivot","prompt":"Orders or capacity?","scenario":"A promotion brings more orders than the team can fulfil by the advertised date.","objective":"Make promises the team can actually keep.","options":[{"id":"a","text":"Limit new orders and offer honest revised delivery choices"},{"id":"b","text":"Silently substitute a lower-quality product"},{"id":"c","text":"Keep accepting every order with the same date"},{"id":"d","text":"Stop replying to buyers"}],"hasUpdate":false}'),
('pivot-medium-3','deal','medium','One loud request','["b"]','Address the demonstrated reliability issue and assess the new request before committing extra work.','','{"format":"pivot","prompt":"One loud request","scenario":"One large prospect asks for a custom feature. Your existing users urgently need a reliability fix.","objective":"Keep current commitments without promising unplanned work.","options":[{"id":"a","text":"Build the custom feature without estimating it"},{"id":"b","text":"Prioritise the reliability fix and scope the request separately"},{"id":"c","text":"Promise both for tomorrow"},{"id":"d","text":"Ignore current users"}],"hasUpdate":false}'),
('pivot-medium-4','deal','medium','The discount trap','["d"]','An offer needs workable economics and delivery capacity; engagement alone cannot establish either.','','{"format":"pivot","prompt":"The discount trap","scenario":"A discount campaign is planned, but nobody has checked its costs or fulfilment capacity.","objective":"Test whether the offer is workable before launch.","options":[{"id":"a","text":"Publish it to create urgency"},{"id":"b","text":"Match the biggest competitor’s discount"},{"id":"c","text":"Judge it only by likes"},{"id":"d","text":"Check contribution, stock and capacity first"}],"hasUpdate":false}'),
('pivot-medium-5','deal','medium','The wrong audience','["a"]','Feedback is most relevant when it comes from the intended buyers and their real operating context.','','{"format":"pivot","prompt":"The wrong audience","scenario":"Students love your prototype, but the product is designed for small-shop owners.","objective":"Validate demand in the intended customer group.","options":[{"id":"a","text":"Test the prototype with small-shop owners"},{"id":"b","text":"Launch nationwide immediately"},{"id":"c","text":"Stop all research"},{"id":"d","text":"Treat student praise as proven shop demand"}],"hasUpdate":false}'),
('pivot-medium-6','deal','medium','One shared password','["a"]','Individual access with suitable permissions makes responsibility clearer and allows access to be revoked separately.','','{"format":"pivot","prompt":"One shared password","scenario":"Five volunteers share one admin account. Nobody can tell who changed an order.","objective":"Improve accountability while keeping access available.","options":[{"id":"a","text":"Give each volunteer appropriate individual access"},{"id":"b","text":"Create another shared password"},{"id":"c","text":"Put the password in a public chat"},{"id":"d","text":"Turn off order history"}],"hasUpdate":false}'),
('pivot-medium-7','deal','medium','A convincing complaint','["b"]','Acknowledge the concern, verify the facts and resolve the specific case without exposing personal information.','','{"format":"pivot","prompt":"A convincing complaint","scenario":"One detailed negative review appears. You have not checked what happened.","objective":"Respond fairly using verified information.","options":[{"id":"a","text":"Post the customer’s personal details"},{"id":"b","text":"Acknowledge it and investigate the order privately"},{"id":"c","text":"Accuse the reviewer of lying"},{"id":"d","text":"Promise compensation before identifying the order"}],"hasUpdate":false}'),
('pivot-medium-8','deal','medium','The silent pilot','["d"]','A large signup count does not explain repeat use. Investigate the actual point of abandonment.','','{"format":"pivot","prompt":"The silent pilot","scenario":"A free pilot has many signups but almost no repeat use.","objective":"Find the barrier to continued use.","options":[{"id":"a","text":"Count signups as retention"},{"id":"b","text":"Buy more traffic immediately"},{"id":"c","text":"Add a compulsory long contract"},{"id":"d","text":"Interview inactive users and inspect where usage stops"}],"hasUpdate":false}'),
('pivot-medium-9','deal','medium','Two deadlines','["a"]','Make the trade-off explicit: protect the essential workflow and communicate a realistic revised commitment.','','{"format":"pivot","prompt":"Two deadlines","scenario":"Your team cannot deliver both promised features on Friday. Customers rely on one for their main task.","objective":"Protect the main task and communicate a feasible plan.","options":[{"id":"a","text":"Prioritise the essential feature and agree a revised date for the other"},{"id":"b","text":"Remove both without notice"},{"id":"c","text":"Add more features to the sprint"},{"id":"d","text":"Promise both unchanged"}],"hasUpdate":false}'),
('pivot-medium-10','deal','medium','The new supplier','["a"]','Verification and a small test order gather evidence before committing the full budget and customer promises.','','{"format":"pivot","prompt":"The new supplier","scenario":"An unknown supplier offers a large order at a lower price, with full payment requested upfront.","objective":"Check delivery and quality before taking a large exposure.","options":[{"id":"a","text":"Verify the supplier and test a small order first"},{"id":"b","text":"Promise customers stock before verification"},{"id":"c","text":"Transfer the full amount today"},{"id":"d","text":"Ignore all lower-price suppliers"}],"hasUpdate":false}'),
('pivot-hard-1','deal','hard','Venue curveball','["a"]','The update rules out the smaller room. The accessible online option accommodates every confirmed attendee.','','{"format":"pivot","prompt":"Venue curveball","scenario":"Your booked room becomes unavailable. You are comparing a smaller room with an online event.","objective":"Keep confirmed attendees together in an accessible session.","options":[{"id":"a","text":"Move to the accessible online format and notify attendees"},{"id":"b","text":"Keep the original venue in all messages"},{"id":"c","text":"Cancel without checking alternatives"},{"id":"d","text":"Move to the smaller room"}],"hasUpdate":true,"update":"The smaller room fits only half the confirmed guests. Every confirmed guest can access the online format."}'),
('pivot-hard-2','deal','hard','Supplier switch','["a"]','The new information confirms compatibility, so the tested substitute is a workable response rather than an untested shortcut.','','{"format":"pivot","prompt":"Supplier switch","scenario":"A launch needs components. Your regular supplier is late; a new supplier offers immediate stock.","objective":"Use components that pass the required compatibility test.","options":[{"id":"a","text":"Use the tested substitute and update the delivery plan"},{"id":"b","text":"Remove the compatibility requirement"},{"id":"c","text":"Wait for the regular delivery"},{"id":"d","text":"Ship the untested substitute"}],"hasUpdate":true,"update":"The substitute has now passed the required test. The regular delivery cannot arrive before launch."}'),
('pivot-hard-3','deal','hard','The false alarm','["b"]','The update separates a broken monitor from a working customer journey. Investigate the monitor without unnecessarily stopping verified purchases.','','{"format":"pivot","prompt":"The false alarm","scenario":"A monitoring alert suggests checkout is failing. You are considering suspending sales.","objective":"Keep working purchases available while checking the reported fault.","options":[{"id":"a","text":"Delete the monitoring history"},{"id":"b","text":"Investigate the monitor while keeping verified checkout available"},{"id":"c","text":"Suspend all sales for a week"},{"id":"d","text":"Ignore the alert without checking"}],"hasUpdate":true,"update":"Real customer orders and an independent test purchase both succeed. The alert comes from a failed monitoring account."}'),
('pivot-hard-4','deal','hard','The large booking','["d"]','Existing confirmed bookings must be honoured. Only uncommitted capacity is available for the new request.','','{"format":"pivot","prompt":"The large booking","scenario":"A company wants every seat at your event. You are deciding whether to release the public allocation.","objective":"Honour existing confirmed bookings.","options":[{"id":"a","text":"Give the company all seats"},{"id":"b","text":"Cancel existing tickets without consultation"},{"id":"c","text":"Hide the existing bookings"},{"id":"d","text":"Offer only uncommitted capacity or a separate session"}],"hasUpdate":true,"update":"Several public tickets have already been paid for and confirmed; those seats are not available to resell."}'),
('pivot-hard-5','deal','hard','A campaign correction','["a"]','The confirmed production update invalidates the shipping promise, so correct it and communicate directly with affected buyers.','','{"format":"pivot","prompt":"A campaign correction","scenario":"Your campaign says orders ship today. A production check may affect that promise.","objective":"Publish a delivery statement supported by the latest confirmed evidence.","options":[{"id":"a","text":"Correct the date and contact affected buyers"},{"id":"b","text":"Wait for delivery complaints"},{"id":"c","text":"Delete the order records"},{"id":"d","text":"Keep today’s promise unchanged"}],"hasUpdate":true,"update":"Production confirms nothing can ship today; the earliest verified dispatch date is three days later."}'),
('pivot-hard-6','deal','hard','Pilot priority','["a"]','The new evidence locates the main failure in onboarding, before users reach the recurring task screen.','','{"format":"pivot","prompt":"Pilot priority","scenario":"You can optimise either onboarding or the recurring task screen this week.","objective":"Fix the point where the target users are demonstrably getting stuck.","options":[{"id":"a","text":"Fix onboarding and repeat the first-use test"},{"id":"b","text":"Rebrand the product"},{"id":"c","text":"Add a new referral campaign"},{"id":"d","text":"Optimise the recurring task screen only"}],"hasUpdate":true,"update":"Observed tests show most target users cannot complete onboarding. Those who complete it can perform the main task."}'),
('pivot-hard-7','deal','hard','Partner branding','["b"]','Permission for an internal presentation does not cover this public announcement. Obtain the right permission or use an approved asset.','','{"format":"pivot","prompt":"Partner branding","scenario":"A partner asks to use a customer photo in tomorrow’s announcement. You are checking approval.","objective":"Publish only material covered by the actual permission.","options":[{"id":"a","text":"Remove the credit but keep the photo"},{"id":"b","text":"Replace it with an approved asset or obtain fresh permission"},{"id":"c","text":"Assume any prior permission covers it"},{"id":"d","text":"Publish and ask afterwards"}],"hasUpdate":true,"update":"The customer approved that photo only for an internal presentation, not for public promotion."}'),
('pivot-hard-8','deal','hard','Capacity surprise','["d"]','Two available sessions with confirmed seating can accommodate the paid bookings without inventing capacity.','','{"format":"pivot","prompt":"Capacity surprise","scenario":"You are planning one combined workshop and checking room capacity.","objective":"Provide a confirmed seat for every paid booking.","options":[{"id":"a","text":"Keep a single session with standing guests"},{"id":"b","text":"Remove names from the booking list"},{"id":"c","text":"Ask extra guests to leave at the door"},{"id":"d","text":"Run two confirmed sessions and let guests select a slot"}],"hasUpdate":true,"update":"The venue confirms half the expected seats, but offers a second equivalent time slot. All bookings can be accommodated across the two."}'),
('pivot-hard-9','deal','hard','Payment verification','["a"]','A screenshot is not independent payment confirmation. Verify the actual transaction before dispatch.','','{"format":"pivot","prompt":"Payment verification","scenario":"A buyer sends a payment screenshot and asks for immediate dispatch.","objective":"Dispatch only after independently verified payment.","options":[{"id":"a","text":"Check the actual transaction and hold dispatch until verified"},{"id":"b","text":"Ask the buyer to crop the screenshot"},{"id":"c","text":"Publish their payment details"},{"id":"d","text":"Dispatch based on the screenshot"}],"hasUpdate":true,"update":"The payment dashboard has no matching transaction, and the screenshot’s reference does not match the order."}'),
('pivot-hard-10','deal','hard','Launch scope','["a"]','The new evidence identifies a failure in the essential workflow. Optional additions do not remove that blocker.','','{"format":"pivot","prompt":"Launch scope","scenario":"You can launch a basic product or wait to include an optional dashboard.","objective":"Launch only when the essential workflow is verified.","options":[{"id":"a","text":"Fix and verify the essential workflow before launch"},{"id":"b","text":"Prioritise the optional dashboard"},{"id":"c","text":"Delay only to change colours"},{"id":"d","text":"Ship without testing the main task"}],"hasUpdate":true,"update":"Testing reveals the main task loses saved work. The optional dashboard works, but customers cannot reliably complete their core task."}')
